<report>
<line><title>Odds ratio analysis</title></line>
<line></line>
<line>Odds Ratio = <in>odds</in></line>
<line></line>
<line>Using the Woolf (logit) approximation:</line>
<line><ci>Approximate <in>woolf_ci</in>% confidence interval = <in>woolf_ci_1</in> to <in>woolf_ci_2</in></ci></line>
<line></line>
<line>Using conditional likelihood estimation:</line>
<line><ci>Fisher exact <in>ci</in>% confidence interval = <in>llf</in> to <in>ulf</in></ci></line>
<line><pval>Exact Fisher one sided <inp>p1f</inp>, two sided <inp>p2f</inp></pval></line>
<line><ci>mid-P exact <in>ci</in>% confidence interval = <in>llm</in> to <in>ulm</in></ci></line>
<line><pval>Exact mid-P one sided <inp>p1m</inp>, two sided <inp>p2m</inp></pval></line>
</report>
